  "createairspace.ponder.airfield_sign.header": "Writing on Airfield Signs",
  "createairspace.ponder.airfield_sign.text_1": "Right-click with a named Name Tag or a Clipboard to write on a row of signs",
  "createairspace.ponder.airfield_sign.text_2": "Display Links can write on them as well",
  "createairspace.ponder.airfield_sign.text_3": "Use a Wrench on the front to switch between location, direction and mandatory signs",
  "createairspace.ponder.airport_beacon.header": "Running Airport Beacons",
  "createairspace.ponder.airport_beacon.text_1": "Rotational force from below turns the head of the beacon",
  "createairspace.ponder.airport_beacon.text_2": "The light is controlled by redstone from the sides. Stronger signals make it brighter and reach further",
  "createairspace.ponder.airport_beacon.text_3": "Use a Wrench to switch between the patterns of land airports, water airports, heliports and military airports",
  "createairspace.ponder.barrier_post.header": "Connecting Barrier Posts",
  "createairspace.ponder.barrier_post.text_1": "Right-click two Barrier Posts with a Wrench to connect them",
  "createairspace.ponder.barrier_post.text_2": "The distance between two posts is limited",
  "createairspace.ponder.barrier_post.text_3": "A post can hold multiple connections, which is great for queue lines",
  "createairspace.ponder.barrier_post.text_4": "Right-click a belt with a dye to change its color",
  "createairspace.ponder.barrier_post.text_5": "Sneak-right-click a belt with a Wrench to remove it",
  "createairspace.ponder.edge_light.header": "Powering Edge Lights",
  "createairspace.ponder.edge_light.text_1": "Edge Lights light up when they receive a redstone signal",
  "createairspace.ponder.edge_light.text_2": "Redstone dust connects to them, so one line can power a whole row",
  "createairspace.ponder.edge_light.text_3": "Use dye to change the color: white, blue, green, red or yellow",
  "createairspace.ponder.runway_marking.header": "Painting Runways",
